// D16604 — an integer constant `??` default that the left side's `i32` cannot hold widens
// the join to `i64`, as the `if` it spells does (ruling 4.3), a folded shift (Q8) as much as
// a decimal. VALUE2 is the radix face, a pattern past 32 bits.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@PRELUDE@@
function none(): i32 | null { return null }
// @@VALUE@@
none() ?? (1 << 40)
// @@TYPE@@
i64
// @@PROOF@@
print(v + 1)
// @@WANT@@
1099511627777
// @@TEST@@
v > 0
// @@HIT@@
print(v + 1)
// @@MISS@@
print(0)
// @@VALUE2@@
none() ?? 0x1FFFFFFFF
// @@TYPE2@@
i64
// @@PROOF2@@
print(v + 1)
// @@WANT2@@
8589934592
